---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---

<Layout title="Machinery buying guides | Shree Ganesh Riddhi Siddhi Traders" description="Practical questions to help businesses compare machinery listings and prepare for a product enquiry.">
	<main id="main-content">
		<Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Guides' }]} />
		<section class="container-page guides-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Useful reading</p><h1>Questions to ask before choosing machinery.</h1><p>Use these practical prompts to compare equipment options and prepare a more useful conversation with a supplier.</p></section>
		<section class="container-page guide-grid">
			<article class="guide-card card"><div class="guide-index">FIELD NOTE · 01</div><p class="eyebrow">Buying checklist</p><h2><a href="/guides/compare-machinery/">How to compare machinery for your business</a></h2><p>A starting checklist for matching a machine to your process, checking specifications, and confirming the terms that matter.</p><a class="text-link" href="/guides/compare-machinery/">Read the guide <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.guides-intro { padding-block: 1rem 2.5rem; }
	.guides-intro h1 { max-width: 54rem; margin: .4rem 0 .7rem; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4.5rem); letter-spacing: -.06em; line-height: 1.04; }
	.guides-intro > p:last-child { max-width: 42rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.08rem; }
	.guide-grid { display: grid; padding-bottom: 5rem; }
	.guide-card { display: grid; justify-items: start; gap: .6rem; max-width: 48rem; padding: clamp(1.2rem,4vw,2rem); }
	.guide-index { width: 100%; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding-bottom: .7rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: .14em; }
	.guide-card .eyebrow { margin: .4rem 0 0; }
	.guide-card h2 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem); line-height: 1.15; }
	.guide-card h2 a { color: var(--body); text-decoration: none; }
	.guide-card h2 a:hover { color: var(--link); }
	.guide-card p:not(.eyebrow) { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }
</style>
